                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7227b593-f92b-30ad-bb27-c35560e53058",
                        "entry_id": "cd3c7744-33f0-317e-94d1-a3915cf575dd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Prénom masculin."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1d72936f-f49c-46c2-9f90-1be480f6e516",
                                "sense_id": "7227b593-f92b-30ad-bb27-c35560e53058",
                                "text": "Jack Lang."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "aec1e5a3-4bb2-4382-ac90-0863aaeb9a34",
                                "sense_id": "7227b593-f92b-30ad-bb27-c35560e53058",
                                "text": "Jack Burns insista pour qu’on ne traversât pas à nouveau le village Huambisas, afin de ne pas effrayer inutilement les indigènes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "054a34d6-b922-4752-82ef-2423ad26da87",
                                "sense_id": "7227b593-f92b-30ad-bb27-c35560e53058",
                                "text": "Monfils a renoncé à poursuivre son match face au Britannique Jack Draper (82e) alors qu’il était mené 6-2, 0-2 et qu’il a semblé être foudroyé par une douleur au pied droit, s’effondrant ensuite au sol."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dd0a96e7-2159-4915-b985-d07946e3bbf7",
                                "sense_id": "7227b593-f92b-30ad-bb27-c35560e53058",
                                "text": "Cette 5ᵉ édition de la compétition a évidemment été marquée, vendredi, par le départ à la retraite de Roger Federer, après un dernier double avec son rival et ami Rafael Nadal, perdu de justesse contre Jack Sock et Frances Tiafoe."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2de6d311-a187-4065-95e0-987262bcdd90",
                                "sense_id": "7227b593-f92b-30ad-bb27-c35560e53058",
                                "text": "Peut-être est-il important de rappeler que, selon la BBC, avant les années 1800, la moitié des hommes anglais portaient les quatre mêmes prénoms: Harry, Oliver, Jack et Charlie!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "89c7e7a2-a4cf-4a83-a799-33d5ca18129d",
                        "source_entry_id": "cd3c7744-33f0-317e-94d1-a3915cf575dd",
                        "source_sense_id": "7227b593-f92b-30ad-bb27-c35560e53058",
                        "target_lang_word": "Jack",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Jack",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9e9406eb-da5f-3ed4-8d31-cadddcbfa09b",
                                        "entry_id": "5f5316d6-2cde-3fa2-af67-8bf3b5257480",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A unisex given name derived from a pet form of the name John. Occasionally a diminutive of other given names such as Jackson, Jacob, Jacqueline or Jonathan."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03c356e4-4177-442b-b2ec-5cb1af86360d",
                                                "sense_id": "9e9406eb-da5f-3ed4-8d31-cadddcbfa09b",
                                                "text": "Since every Jack became a gentleman\nthere's many a gentle person made a Jack."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "68d5f35e-8274-4354-be8f-d912153f5cf2",
                                                "sense_id": "9e9406eb-da5f-3ed4-8d31-cadddcbfa09b",
                                                "text": "Heere comes leane Iacke, heere comes bare-bone. How now my ſweet Creature of Bombaſt, how long is't agoe, Iacke, ſince thou ſaw'ſt thine owne Knee?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ab09355a-43f8-405d-b666-1b4854358c2c",
                                                "sense_id": "9e9406eb-da5f-3ed4-8d31-cadddcbfa09b",
                                                "text": "JACK. Well, really, Gwendolen, I must say that I think that there are lots of other much nicer names. I think Jack, for instance, a charming name.\nGWENDOLEN. Jack?...No, there is very little music in the name Jack, if any at all, indeed. It does not thrill. It produces absolutely no vibrations...I have known several Jacks, and they all, without exception, were more than usually plain. Besides, Jack is a notorious domesticity for John!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d05b6bb5-ffe7-4b77-900b-24b8556039aa",
                                                "sense_id": "9e9406eb-da5f-3ed4-8d31-cadddcbfa09b",
                                                "text": "Chief Judge Jack Tuter, who oversees the 17th Judicial Circuit Court in Fort Lauderdale, released a statement over the weekend berating Ehrlich for her conduct."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9af50147-0c77-3811-b1d3-4fd4602b1e97",
                                        "entry_id": "5f5316d6-2cde-3fa2-af67-8bf3b5257480",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A surname."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "77104f8b-d855-3dd0-86fa-ba296590ff53",
                                        "entry_id": "5f5316d6-2cde-3fa2-af67-8bf3b5257480",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Jack Daniel's, a brand of Tennessee whiskey."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "272be661-bf14-49e4-92e7-ca54ef9d5a11",
                                                "sense_id": "77104f8b-d855-3dd0-86fa-ba296590ff53",
                                                "text": "Before I leave, brush my teeth with a bottle of Jack."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e592a57a-1f4a-4ed8-b8aa-0f98b21e612d",
                                                "sense_id": "77104f8b-d855-3dd0-86fa-ba296590ff53",
                                                "text": "Got a boy back home in Michigan / And it tastes like Jack when I'm kissing him / So I told him that I never really liked his friends / Now he's gone and he's calling me a bitch again"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6a122c6e-ac0d-366e-8008-181a2e0fa79b",
                                        "entry_id": "5f5316d6-2cde-3fa2-af67-8bf3b5257480",
